---
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="font-serif antialiased">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>OC-Free-Model-Video</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --ground: #f2efe8;
        --ink: #0a0a0a;
        --ink-muted: #6b6b6b;
        --ink-soft: #8a8a8a;
        --rule: #1a1a1a14;
        --accent: #2e1a47;
        --muted: #eeeae1;
        --font-display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-serif: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji";
        --font-mono: "JetBrainsMono", "SF Mono", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html, body {
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-feature-settings: "kern", "liga", "onum";
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        text-rendering: optimizelegibility;
        line-height: 1.5;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      body {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      main {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: 56rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 1.6vw, 2.75rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-style: italic;
      }

      section {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      section:first-child {
        border-top: none;
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      p {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      strong {
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      code {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 0.2em 0.4em;
        border-radius: 0.2em;
        font-size: 0.9em;
      }

      pre {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        background: var(--muted);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        line-height: 1.55;
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }

      ul {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 42ch;
        margin-left: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      li {
        margin: 0.375rem 0;
      }

      a {
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.14s, border-color 0.14s;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
        padding-bottom: 0.5px;
      }

      hr {
        border: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      /* === New components === */

      .demo-box {
        background: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }

      .model-chip {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.3rem;
        background: var(--ground);
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        margin: 0.2rem;
      }

      .cap-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
        margin-left: 0.3rem;
        border-radius: 0.2rem;
      }
      .cap-yes { background: var(--muted); color: var(--ink); }
      .cap-no { background: var(--ground); color: var(--ink-soft); }

      table.cap-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }
      table.cap-table th,
      table.cap-table td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
      table.cap-table th {
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }
      table.cap-table tr:hover td { background: var(--ground); }

      .calc-result {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--accent);
        text-align: center;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      .calc-input {
        background: var(--ground);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.3rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        width: 100px;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .project-card {
        background: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--rule);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .project-card h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .project-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

      .grid-2col {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --ground: #171410;
          --ink: #e7e2d8;
          --ink-muted: #a39b8d;
          --ink-soft: #837b6f;
          --rule: #f2efe81a;
          --accent: #b3a1d6;
          --muted: #211d18;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>

      <h1>OC-Free-Model-Video</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Use OpenRouter's free router in OpenCode for small coding tasks and experiments.</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Install OpenCode</h2>
        <p>On macOS with Homebrew, run:</p>
        <pre><code>brew install anomalyco/tap/opencode</code></pre>
        <p>If you already have OpenCode, skip this step. Other platforms can use the installation guide.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Connect your OpenRouter key</h2>
        <p>Create an API key at OpenRouter. Then launch OpenCode:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode</code></pre>
        <p>Inside its terminal interface, type <code>/connect</code>, choose <strong>OpenRouter</strong>, and paste the key. OpenCode saves provider credentials separately from your config. See the provider instructions.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Set the free router as your default</h2>
        <p>Search and select it in the model picker.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Test it</h2>
        <p>Exit OpenCode and run:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode models openrouter
opencode run -m openrouter/openrouter/free "Reply with: setup works"</code></pre>
        <p>The model list should include <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code>. A reply confirms that authentication and routing work.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Use it in a project</h2>
        <p>From your project directory, start:</p>
        <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free</code></pre>
        <p>Try a small task: "Read the README and explain how to run this project." Use <code>/models</code> to switch models later.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Model capability reference</h2>
        <p>The free router dynamically selects models based on your request. Here are the capabilities you can expect from models commonly rotated in:</p>
        <table class="cap-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th style="text-align:center">Model</th><th style="text-align:center">Tool Calling</th><th style="text-align:center">Vision</th><th style="text-align:center">Context</th><th style="text-align:center">Typical Use</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Mistral 7B</td><td class="cap-yes">Yes</td><td class="cap-no">No</td><td>8K</td><td>Simple tasks</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Gemma 2 9B</td><td class="cap-yes">Yes</td><td class="cap-no">No</td><td>8K</td><td>Coding help</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Qwen 2.5 7B</td><td class="cap-yes">Yes</td><td class="cap-no">No</td><td>32K</td><td>Long context</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Phi-3 Mini</td><td class="cap-yes">Yes</td><td class="cap-yes">Yes</td><td>4K</td><td>Multimodal</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>Because the model can change between requests, always test critical capabilities like tool calling in your specific session. Use <code>/models</code> to pin to a specific model when you need consistency.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Free router demo</h2>
        <p>Type a sample prompt below to see how the free router would categorize it and which model it might select:</p>
        <div class="demo-box">
          <label for="task-input" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-soft);">Prompt</label><br />
          <input id="task-input" type="text" placeholder="e.g. fix this bug" style="width: 100%; background: var(--ground); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 0.25rem; padding: 0.4rem; font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink); margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;" />
          <button onclick="handleDemo()" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink); background: var(--ground); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 0.25rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; cursor: pointer;">Analyze</button>
          <div id="demo-output" style="margin-top: 1rem;"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Cost savings calculator</h2>
        <p>Estimate your monthly savings by using the free router instead of a paid model like GPT-4o:</p>
        <form id="calc-form" onsubmit="return handleCalc(event)">
          <div class="grid-2col">
            <div>
              <label style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-soft);">Requests / day</label>
              <input id="req-day" class="calc-input" type="number" value="20" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-soft);">Tokens / req</label>
              <input id="tok-req" class="calc-input" type="number" value="1500" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin: 1rem 0;">
            <label style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-soft);">Model price ($/1k tokens)</label>
            <input id="price" class="calc-input" type="number" step="0.01" value="0.03" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>
          <button type="submit" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink); background: var(--ground); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 0.25rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; cursor: pointer;">Calculate</button>
        </form>
        <div id="calc-output"></div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Rate limit handling</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Free router requests are subject to OpenRouter rate limits. Expect <strong>429</strong> errors under load.</li>
          <li>Read the <code>Retry-After</code> header (seconds) and pass it to a delay before retrying.</li>
          <li>Implement exponential backoff in scripts: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, max 30s.</li>
          <li>Cache responses when the same prompt recurs to avoid redundant calls.</li>
          <li>If a task is urgent or long-running, temporarily switch with <code>/models</code> to a paid model you're comfortable with.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Starter projects</h2>
        <p>Small projects well-suited for free-router experimentation:</p>

        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>README Explainer</h3>
          <p>Read a project's README and generate a 2-paragraph summary plus setup checklist.</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free
"Read the README and summarize how to run this project"</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>Code Refactor</h3>
          <p>Give the free router a single function and ask it to improve readability without changing behavior.</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free
"Refactor this to be more readable — keep the same output: refactor_me.py"</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>CSS Animation Generator</h3>
          <p>Ask for a small CSS snippet and a demo HTML file for a specific animation effect.</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free
"Create a pure-CSS shimmer sweep effect on a text label and a demo HTML file"</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>Data Formatter</h3>
          <p>Convert a CSV to JSON, normalize field names, or extract columns from a data file.</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free
"Normalize column names to camelCase and output JSON: data/sample.csv"</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
          <h3>CLI Wrapper</h3>
          <p>Build a tiny CLI tool that wraps a public API (e.g., a weather or exchange-rate endpoint).</p>
          <pre><code>opencode -m openrouter/openrouter/free
"Build a CLI that calls the Open-Meteo API and prints the forecast for a city arg"</code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>If it fails</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A model-not-found error: confirm the full ID <code>openrouter/openrouter/free</code> above and restart OpenCode.</li>
          <li>An authentication error: reconnect your OpenRouter key with <code>/connect</code>.</li>
          <li>Rate limit (429): wait before retrying and follow the retry delay in the error headers.</li>
          <li>Output too long: add a length or complexity constraint to the prompt.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Docs checked September 30, 2026.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script is:inline src="/demo.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>